{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "flip-cue-1",
      "transcript": "Scientists deliberately tipped this floating laboratory upright. Why?",
      "file": "audio/flip/narration/cue-1.wav",
      "start": 0,
      "duration": 4.75,
      "beatIndex": 0,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "flip-floating-laboratory.asset.measurement.script.1",
      "samples": 114000,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "flip-cue-2",
      "transcript": "Because when your instrument moves, it’s harder to tell what the ocean is doing.",
      "file": "audio/flip/narration/cue-2.wav",
      "start": 5.066666666666666,
      "duration": 4.8,
      "beatIndex": 1,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "flip-floating-laboratory.asset.measurement.script.2",
      "samples": 115200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "flip-cue-3",
      "transcript": "FLIP was built to study underwater sound. Even a research submarine turned enough to limit those measurements.",
      "file": "audio/flip/narration/cue-3.wav",
      "start": 10.033333333333333,
      "duration": 7.025,
      "beatIndex": 2,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "flip-floating-laboratory.asset.measurement.script.3",
      "samples": 168600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "flip-cue-4",
      "transcript": "So engineers made a laboratory that travelled horizontally, then flooded ballast tanks to lower its stern.",
      "file": "audio/flip/narration/cue-4.wav",
      "start": 17.233333333333334,
      "duration": 6.775,
      "beatIndex": 3,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "flip-floating-laboratory.asset.measurement.script.4",
      "samples": 162600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "flip-cue-5",
      "transcript": "The lab stayed above water, while about ninety metres of hull extended beneath it.",
      "file": "audio/flip/narration/cue-5.wav",
      "start": 24.2,
      "duration": 5.35,
      "beatIndex": 4,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "flip-floating-laboratory.asset.measurement.script.5",
      "samples": 128400,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "flip-cue-6",
      "transcript": "Look at the shape: a narrow section near the surface, with a broader hull deep below.",
      "file": "audio/flip/narration/cue-6.wav",
      "start": 29.866666666666667,
      "duration": 5.325,
      "beatIndex": 5,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "flip-floating-laboratory.asset.measurement.script.6",
      "samples": 127800,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "flip-cue-7",
      "transcript": "In deep water, the motion caused by surface waves weakens with depth.",
      "file": "audio/flip/narration/cue-7.wav",
      "start": 35.36666666666667,
      "duration": 4.725,
      "beatIndex": 6,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "flip-floating-laboratory.asset.measurement.script.7",
      "samples": 113400,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "flip-cue-8",
      "transcript": "FLIP’s shape made it much less responsive to those waves.",
      "file": "audio/flip/narration/cue-8.wav",
      "start": 40.4,
      "duration": 3.575,
      "beatIndex": 7,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "flip-floating-laboratory.asset.measurement.script.8",
      "samples": 85800,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "flip-cue-9",
      "transcript": "It could still drift and tilt. Stable didn’t mean motionless.",
      "file": "audio/flip/narration/cue-9.wav",
      "start": 44.166666666666664,
      "duration": 4.1,
      "beatIndex": 8,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "flip-floating-laboratory.asset.measurement.script.9",
      "samples": 98400,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "flip-cue-10",
      "transcript": "And when the work was done, compressed air pushed water out of the ballast tanks, returning it to horizontal.",
      "file": "audio/flip/narration/cue-10.wav",
      "start": 48.56666666666667,
      "duration": 6.45,
      "beatIndex": 9,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "flip-floating-laboratory.asset.measurement.script.10",
      "samples": 154800,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "flip-cue-11",
      "transcript": "They tipped the laboratory upright to make a moving ocean easier to measure.",
      "file": "audio/flip/narration/cue-11.wav",
      "start": 55.2,
      "duration": 4.825,
      "beatIndex": 10,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "flip-floating-laboratory.asset.measurement.script.11",
      "samples": 115800,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    }
  ],
